   "id": 12,
   "text": "Ljunggren, D. (2026). “Canada’s share of exports to U.S. hit lowest level in decades in October.” CBC News <a href=\"https://www.cbc.ca/news/business/canada-trade-oct-2025-9.7037913\">https://www.cbc.ca/news/business/canada-trade-oct-2025-9.7037913</a> – Posted January 8, 2026"
